// Wick
// A precision platformer: Wick, a candle flame, runs, jumps and wall-jumps through one-screen rooms to light the lantern
// in each (docs/carts/wick.md). Step 1: his movement, the rooms from the ROM, death and the instant restart.

// --- Colours: the default palette (DawnBringer 16). The overlay's index 0 is transparent. ---

const SHADOW = 1, PANEL = 3, RED = 6, DIM = 10, GREEN = 11, CYAN = 13, GOLD = 14, WHITE = 15;

